add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type echo-request accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type echo-request accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type time-exceeded accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type echo-request accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type 42 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type destination-unreachable icmp code 1 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT icmp type != echo-request drop
add table ip6 ferm
delete table ip6 ferm
add table ip6 ferm
add chain ip6 ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT icmpv6 type nd-neighbor-solicit accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT icmpv6 type nd-router-advert accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT icmpv6 type nd-redirect accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT icmpv6 type echo-request accept
add rule ip6 ferm INPUT icmpv6 type destination-unreachable icmpv6 code 4 accept
